  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-07-10T11:45:00-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, July 10, 2018, 11:45 am\">July 10, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p><img class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-3926\" src=\"/media/archive/9a1d708b9d5eba74c54847aef9201fb22e4f000efc18b192fecb484cbda70df3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"791\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" />Guild of Harwich Artist Anne Briggs will exhibit in the Cape Cod Art Center’s “The National 2018 Exhibit” which runs July 16 – August 12. Her piece “Spring Thing 3” is feature on the promotional material.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-bc2e4bef39a39f9eb9e9/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY ARTISTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t<br /><span class=\"entry-terms post_tag\">Tagged <a href=\"/archive/source-252f1ae48dd294e4f06d/\" rel=\"tag\">Anne Briggs</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-f2a631a3e003de1b1e3a/\" rel=\"tag\">Cape Cod Art Center</a></span>\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
